WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:03.071
Ben looked up as he clung to the rope.

2
00:00:03.072 --> 00:00:05.189
"What's going on?" he thought.

3
00:00:05.190 --> 00:00:09.974
Then he spotted Serena crossing the field with Winnie.

4
00:00:09.975 --> 00:00:13.767
"Whoa." A few monsters started whispering.

5
00:00:13.768 --> 00:00:17.399
"Who's that beautiful witch?"

6
00:00:17.400 --> 00:00:23.084
"Hi, Serena!" Pixel called, waving madly. "I—oops!"

7
00:00:23.085 --> 00:00:27.343
As soon as Pixel dropped the rope, Zork seized the opportunity.

8
00:00:27.344 --> 00:00:32.843
"Pull, Team Orange!" he shouted.

9
00:00:32.844 --> 00:00:37.453
Before Ben could react, he felt the rope slip through his hands.

10
00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:43.028
A second later Mog landed in the mud pit, splattering mud everywhere.

11
00:00:43.029 --> 00:00:48.685
Pixel fell in next, followed by Deb, Ben, and finally Jen.

12
00:00:48.686 --> 00:00:51.188
Team Orange laughed and cheered.

13
00:00:51.189 --> 00:00:58.889
Their fans went wild too, chanting, "Orange! Orange!"

14
00:00:58.890 --> 00:01:09.473
"One point for Team Orange!" Mr. Gwarg declared.

15
00:01:09.474 --> 00:01:12.663
Team Black pulled themselves out of the mud.

16
00:01:12.664 --> 00:01:16.832
Mog looked disappointed, but he tried to shake it off.

17
00:01:16.833 --> 00:01:19.204
"Okay, Team Black, good effort.

18
00:01:19.205 --> 00:01:23.716
But if we want to win, we're going to need more focus."

19
00:01:23.717 --> 00:01:27.447
"Sorry, everybody," Pixel mumbled.

20
00:01:27.448 --> 00:01:33.391
"I got distracted by, um, somebody."

21
00:01:33.392 --> 00:01:37.972
Mr. Freaky was racing around, waving his arms happily.

22
00:01:37.973 --> 00:01:40.747
"What an exciting start to Field Day!

23
00:01:40.748 --> 00:01:48.294
Get cleaned up, Team Black, and we'll move on to the next event."

24
00:01:48.295 --> 00:01:51.847
Ben wiped himself down as best he could.

25
00:01:51.848 --> 00:01:54.623
Then he went over to talk to Gaby.

26
00:01:54.624 --> 00:01:59.136
"Nice win," he said. "I sure wish you were on our team, though."

27
00:01:59.137 --> 00:02:03.002
"Me too." Gaby folded her arms and scowled.

28
00:02:03.003 --> 00:02:07.881
"But Mog—and Waldo—never asked me to be on Team Black."

29
00:02:07.882 --> 00:02:10.447
"I should have thought of asking you," Ben said.

30
00:02:10.448 --> 00:02:12.360
"But I was worried about Winnie yesterday.

31
00:02:12.361 --> 00:02:15.380
She seems so bothered by her cousin or something."

32
00:02:15.381 --> 00:02:18.967
"I think Winnie is jealous of Serena," Gaby said.

33
00:02:18.968 --> 00:02:21.191
"Which is dumb, if you ask me.

34
00:02:21.192 --> 00:02:25.532
Serena's beautiful, but Winnie's really pretty too."

35
00:02:25.533 --> 00:02:28.444
Ben nodded. "I know."

36
00:02:28.445 --> 00:02:33.433
"She's even letting it get in the way of Field Day," Gaby went on.

37
00:02:33.434 --> 00:02:39.424
"Zork asked her to join Team Orange, but she told him she was too busy with her cousin."

38
00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:43.700
At the mention of Zork, Ben just grunted.

39
00:02:43.701 --> 00:02:49.726
"Well, good luck with the sack race, Gaby. It should be another good competition."

40
00:02:49.727 --> 00:02:56.605
A few minutes later, the two teams stood with Mr. Gwarg near a white line on the field.

41
00:02:56.606 --> 00:03:01.683
"This is the starting line for the sack race," the gym teacher explained.

42
00:03:01.684 --> 00:03:07.172
"And remember, there is absolutely no floating or flying in this event.

43
00:03:07.173 --> 00:03:13.851
Your feet must stay in the bag, and you must hop to the finish line. Got it?"

44
00:03:13.852 --> 00:03:17.082
"Got it," all the monsters replied.

45
00:03:17.083 --> 00:03:21.454
"In the first heat, three members from each team will race.

46
00:03:21.462 --> 00:03:25.159
Then the other three members will take a turn.

47
00:03:25.160 --> 00:03:30.727
The top two finishers from each team will go on to the final round.

48
00:03:30.728 --> 00:03:35.395
Now find your sacks, hoppers!"

49
00:03:35.396 --> 00:03:40.328
Brunhilda, Carly, and Gaby climbed into their sacks for Team Orange.

50
00:03:40.329 --> 00:03:45.727
Pixel, Mog, and Waldo were going to be Team Black's first hoppers.

51
00:03:45.728 --> 00:03:49.750
"Hop as fast as you can!" Mog said.

52
00:03:49.751 --> 00:03:52.942
"Aye-aye, Captain," Pixel and Waldo said.

53
00:03:52.943 --> 00:03:59.916
Mr. Gwarg raised his whistle. "Ready . . . set . . ." Tweet!

54
00:03:59.917 --> 00:04:08.011
As Gaby took off, her long legs immediately got caught in the sack, and she toppled forward onto her face. "Oof!"

55
00:04:08.012 --> 00:04:10.437
"Get up, Gaby!" Zork yelled.

56
00:04:10.438 --> 00:04:16.124
"Don't just lie there!" Gaby tried to get up, but she got even more tangled.

57
00:04:16.125 --> 00:04:21.570
Brunhilda had been laughing as she hopped past Gaby.

58
00:04:21.571 --> 00:04:25.077
But a second later, she plunged forward too.

59
00:04:25.078 --> 00:04:28.660
Ben held his breath, watching his teammates.

60
00:04:28.661 --> 00:04:34.709
Mog seemed focused only on the finish line as he hopped across the field.

61
00:04:34.710 --> 00:04:41.617
Waldo wasn't too far behind Mog, but he kept having to stop to push his glasses up on his nose.

62
00:04:41.618 --> 00:04:46.220
Meanwhile Pixel looked as if he was drowning inside his sack.

63
00:04:46.221 --> 00:04:49.219
It was much too large for the tiny ghost.

64
00:04:49.220 --> 00:04:52.005
"Go, Team Black!" Ben shouted.

65
00:04:52.006 --> 00:04:57.160
"Feet, do your stuff!" Carly called out suddenly.

66
00:04:57.161 --> 00:05:01.407
Then she began leaping forward with huge hops.

67
00:05:01.408 --> 00:05:03.329
"Uh-oh," Ben thought.

68
00:05:03.330 --> 00:05:09.577
Carly was rapidly catching up to Mog! "Go, Mog, go!" Ben shouted.

69
00:05:09.578 --> 00:05:20.687
The racers kept going.

70
00:05:20.688 --> 00:05:25.963
Mog dived for the finish line just as Carly took one last enormous leap.

71
00:05:25.964 --> 00:05:31.867
Mr. Gwarg had crouched down to watch the finish line.

72
00:05:31.868 --> 00:05:39.575
He stood back up. "And the winner is . . . Mog!"

73
00:05:39.576 --> 00:05:43.343
"What?" Mog was still lying on the ground.

74
00:05:43.344 --> 00:05:49.148
"You won. Carly is the second-place winner," Mr. Gwarg said.

75
00:05:49.149 --> 00:05:53.079
"Rats!" Carly cried, stepping out of her sack.

76
00:05:53.080 --> 00:06:00.645
The crowd gasped. In place of her normal feet, Carly had huge kangaroo feet.

77
00:06:00.646 --> 00:06:04.516
"Hey! No fair!" a goblin yelled.

78
00:06:04.517 --> 00:06:07.577
Team Black was complaining loudly too.

79
00:06:07.578 --> 00:06:12.636
Mog pointed at Carly's feet. "She used magic!"

80
00:06:12.637 --> 00:06:15.607
Carly grinned and stuck out her tongue at him.

81
00:06:15.608 --> 00:06:20.552
"No, I didn't. It's not magic—it's an ability. Remember?

82
00:06:20.553 --> 00:06:29.252
I'm a doppelganger. And doppelgangers can change shape."

83
00:06:29.253 --> 00:06:34.618
Deb scowled. "Two can play this game," she muttered.

